; **The floor's own threat, and the roster's whole argument.** It teleports to a room's edge, which is
; the player's trick answered with the player's trick — and it is the only enemy in the game that can
; cross a cable duct, so it is the only one that can follow somebody out of a fight they left.
;
; The Data Center excluded it on the grounds that nothing a player learns about holding ground applies
; to it, which was right for a floor about holding ground. Here that is the qualification rather than
; the objection. Weighted highest of the six because a mobility floor whose enemies are all stationary
; is a floor where the mechanic is a convenience.
weight = 1.6
min_difficulty = 2
